<p>Randomly teleports all enemies within a radius of three.  Enemies will be teleported between <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">8, 10, 12, 14, 16</acronym> tiles from you and may be stunned, blinded, confused, or pinned for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns.</p><p>The chance of teleportion will scale with your Spellpower.</p>